OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Fshowery rain will extend westwards to
OL,7,Faffect much of England and Wales
OL,8,Fthrough this evening and overnight,
OL,9,Fthe rain locally heavy. Scotland and
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland will have clear
OL,11,Fperiods, with some frost and fog
OL,12,Fforming in places.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FRain will move from England
OL,15,Fand Wales into Northern Ireland,
OL,16,Fsouthern and eastern Scotland on
OL,17,FMonday. Brighter skies following into
OL,18,Fthe south, and mostly sunny across
OL,19,Fnorthern and western Scotland.
